{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2d72f9d3-fe0d-8eb9-807b-18325cddf94e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T12:27:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Doug G. Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:24:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, happy almost New Year. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:24:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Doug Sherman. I have a few questions written down here about the beaches, if you have a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go right ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:24:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First one is parking. What are the rules for parking at the city beaches in the off-season? Is it open to anyone this time of year, or is there a sticker or a fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So in the winter it's a lot more relaxed than summer. The seasonal beach parking rules mostly apply in the warm months, so right now you can generally just pull in. But posted signs always win, so check the signs at the lot when you get there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So no attendant and no sticker needed right now, but read the signs. Let me write that down. [pause] Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:25:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Are you thinking of a walk on the beach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly. My real reason is the second item on my note. I want to get back to the summer concerts out on the island. I haven't been in some years and I'd like to go again this coming season."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, nice. Those are a lovely time. Are you asking about parking for those, or how to find the schedule?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:25:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, really. Where would I find out about the schedule, and would the beach parking rules be the same on a concert night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The schedule usually gets posted in the spring, and we put it on the city website and the recreation page. I can't tell you tonight's rules for a summer evening because those get set closer to the season. Parking in summer is different from what I told you for winter, so don't count on the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:25:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. That makes sense. So nothing is settled yet for summer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Nothing is final until spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:26:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My third question, then. If the answer I get now doesn't work out, say the rules change or the sign at the lot says something different, what should I do? Who do I call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Call us back here in the spring and we'll tell you what's current. If you're standing at the lot and the sign contradicts what I said, go with the sign. If you'd like, I can take your name and number and have someone from the department call you when the summer information is out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would appreciate that. The number is 401-555-0196. Name is Doug Sherman, S-H-E-R-M-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Doug Sherman, 401-555-0196. I'll put in a note for a call back in the spring about the concerts and the parking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:26:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That covers everything on my list. I appreciate your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon, and a happy New Year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T12:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same to you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
